This is to inform you that the Board of Directors of the Safecure Services Limited ('the Company') at its meeting held today i.e. Saturday, November 14, 2026, has approved/noted the following matters: 
1. Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results for the half year ended September 30, 2026, along with the Limited Review Report issued by the Statutory Auditors of the Company;
2. Noted the Statement of Deviation(s) or Variation(s) under Regulation 32 of the Listing Regulations for the quarter ended September 30, 2026, as reviewed by the Audit Committee, together with the certificate of HRJ Associates, Chartered Accountants, on utilisation of the IPO proceeds.
